{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t重建後的皇崗口岸早上正式開通，不少市民和旅客試用新口岸過關，本台實測大約一分鐘內，經自助通道 「三道閘門」完成來往兩地通關手續。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n有市民認為通關過程快捷方便，亦有使用口岸的跨境車司機表示，車道查驗過程大致順暢。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T10:59:09.772672+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:50:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T12:37:46.104005+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:57:40.098221+00:00","content_hash":"f590107ed0842d182efa8e08d5e925512bd16694a2657803d782e06c9f2bab53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}